 "hast": "\n<p>These registries are built into the CLI with no additional configuration required. To add a component, run: <code>npx shadcn add @&#x3C;registry>/&#x3C;component></code>.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"Callout\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;bg-muted font-semibold&#x22;}]\"><p>Community registries are maintained by third-party developers. Always review\ncode on installation to ensure it meets your security and quality standards.</p></mdx-jsx>\n<p>Don't see a registry? Learn how to <a href=\"/docs/registry/registry-index\">add it here</a>.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"DirectoryList\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"documentation\">Documentation</h2>\n<p>You can use the <code>shadcn</code> CLI to run your own code registry. Running your own registry allows you to distribute your custom components, hooks, pages, config, rules and other files to any project.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"div\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2&#x22;}]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"LinkedCard\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;href&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/docs/registry/getting-started&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;items-start text-sm md:p-6&#x22;}]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"div\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;font-medium&#x22;}]\">Getting Started</mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"div\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;text-muted-foreground&#x22;}]\"><p>Set up and build your own registry</p></mdx-jsx></mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"LinkedCard\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;href&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/docs/registry/authentication&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;v